        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7cf6dc8b-977b-43df-9308-5164644c9b77).Image",
        "Description": "5 people were recently seen at a meeting together to gather intel on a possible CIA sting. They don&apos;t know that the man they are watching is very wealthy, and had an insider who blew the whole plan off the rails. 47 your job is go there and take out all the agents sent to gather intel on our client. Including his Insider.\r\rFairchild is the leader of the operation, and Fisher is the insider who told us about the rest. Then there&apos;s Harris. He might know were coming so he could be more cautious.",
